       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 42-137
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7679535"
    >
Reports.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7679535" data-guid="7679535"></div>
        <div id="questions-7679535" data-guid="7679535" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7679535_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The Commission shall file an annual report by June 30 of each year with the Common Council and the Mayor summarizing the work and activities of the Commission since the previous June.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
